msgid "A failed model call passes through five retry layers in order, from innermost to outermost:<0> Connection → Empty response → Same-provider safe window → Pool circuit breaker → Intent rerun</0>. The outer layer only kicks in once the inner one is exhausted, so the counts <1>multiply</1> — max out every layer and a single hiccup can burn through dozens of requests. Leave everything empty for the current defaults, identical to the behavior without this page. The first three layers can be overridden per model profile."
msgstr "A failed model call passes through five retry layers in order, from innermost to outermost:<0> Connection → Empty response → Same-provider safe window → Pool circuit breaker → Intent rerun</0>. The outer layer only kicks in once the inner one is exhausted, so the counts <1>multiply</1> — max out every layer and a single hiccup can burn through dozens of requests. Leave everything empty for the current defaults, identical to the behavior without this page. The first three layers can be overridden per model profile."

